A||||8||Fierochic88||Much Better Fiero Week - THANKS SKITIME & FLEABIT!||||1||
Z||000000||Fierochic88||07-28-2001||12:02 AM||||Well this has been a much better Fiero week.  The engine in Dad's car is back together and almost ready to go back in the car, completely clean and looking good...honestly I'm convinced he made up the rod knock story just to get his engine out and cleaned before Nationals!  My car was also fixed this week, with new rear wheel bearings and the major culprit found in the tires I had just put on (GoodYear Eagle GT II's).  Apparently the tires were faulty or just plain crap and the tire place upon looking at the car and discussing it with my dad and Skitime decided to give me 4 new tires at a very good cost (essentially $25 a tire after they bought the other tires back).  So hopefully the problem is 100% cured.  All of this would not have been possible if it weren't for the help of SkiTime and Fleabit!  Fleabit came down and helped my dad repair his tranny on Monday and Ski has been here several times this week and has been a tremendous help in many departments!  Also thanks to Vonnie (Veronica'sGT) for all of her help too!  Those of us who live in this area of PA are fortunate to have such great Fiero neighbors!<P>Jennifer<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||turbo86se||07-28-2001||11:58 AM||||I wish I knew Fiero-owners like Dave and Veronica down here in Myrtle! Very nice people. Hey anytime you want to come down to Myrtle Beach for a vacation, you've got a free place to stay! Just don't take the turbo out in the middle of the night!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||AkursedX||07-28-2001||05:19 PM||||Glad to hear it Jennifer!!  You must've been pretty busy having to work on two Fieros at the same time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  I got my GT up and running and hopefully I will be able to make it to Virgina after all  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||skitime||07-28-2001||09:30 PM||||Thanks for the kind words Jennifer.  We of course enjoy your spending time with your family. <P>Turbo86se - Thanks for the kind words too. That invite to Myrtle Beach actually sounds like fun.  I at least better get a ride in that turbo.<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
